  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.250" end="00:09.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ahaha)</p>
      <p begin="00:09.910" end="00:17.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Crystal made this shit)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.170" end="00:21.780" ttm:agent="v1">Aye no cops no stops, I'm pushin' 180 on the block</p>
      <p begin="00:21.780" end="00:24.720" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gang sellin' rock and I heard that you an opp</p>
      <p begin="00:24.720" end="00:26.580" ttm:agent="v1">Your whip clapped and your bitch a bot</p>
      <p begin="00:26.580" end="00:28.850" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm good with the hoes n' your not yuh</p>
      <p begin="00:28.850" end="00:31.520" ttm:agent="v1">Aye don't pull up to the meet if you driving an EV</p>
      <p begin="00:31.520" end="00:34.140" ttm:agent="v1">We'll kick you out, spin yo' block like a CD</p>
      <p begin="00:34.140" end="00:38.220" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck your J-series, that's easy, black whip blacked tint, can't see me</p>
      <p begin="00:38.220" end="00:41.570" ttm:agent="v1">Aye no cops no stops, I'm pushin' 180 on the block</p>
      <p begin="00:41.570" end="00:44.490" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gang sellin' rock and I heard that you an opp</p>
      <p begin="00:44.490" end="00:46.200" ttm:agent="v1">Your whip clapped and your bitch a bot</p>
      <p begin="00:46.200" end="00:48.600" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm good with the hoes n' your not yuh</p>
      <p begin="00:48.600" end="00:51.120" ttm:agent="v1">Aye don't pull up to the meet if you driving an EV</p>
      <p begin="00:51.120" end="00:53.730" ttm:agent="v1">We'll kick you out, spin yo' block like a CD</p>
      <p begin="00:53.730" end="00:58.690" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck your J-series, that's easy, black whip blacked tint, can't see me</p>
      <p begin="00:58.690" end="01:00.960" ttm:agent="v1">I got big cams, now lets get to shoppin'</p>
      <p begin="01:00.960" end="01:03.440" ttm:agent="v1">And you ain't pushin' shit, lil' bitch quit the talking</p>
      <p begin="01:03.440" end="01:05.600" ttm:agent="v1">And I pull up to the meet and all the bitches get to hoppin'</p>
      <p begin="01:05.600" end="01:08.200" ttm:agent="v1">I got hoes with diffеrent clothes and all they boyfriеnds tryna' lock in</p>
      <p begin="01:08.200" end="01:13.030" ttm:agent="v1">Don't hit me on your payphone, yo' man don't gotta call, you got a bank loan</p>
      <p begin="01:13.030" end="01:18.290" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck a 5, man be stayin' slow, and you hit cause I hit the bank roll</p>
      <p begin="01:18.290" end="01:20.750" ttm:agent="v1">And I break laws on my own damn street</p>
      <p begin="01:20.750" end="01:23.020" ttm:agent="v1">I be in the Z, I got Nismo on my feet</p>
      <p begin="01:23.020" end="01:25.420" ttm:agent="v1">Only got two doors, why the fuck I needin' four</p>
      <p begin="01:25.420" end="01:27.920" ttm:agent="v1">Plus my whip move faster when I'm driving it alone</p>
      <p begin="01:27.920" end="01:33.100" ttm:agent="v1">Your SS slow, your RT slow, your scatpack slow and it flip like a boat</p>
      <p begin="01:33.100" end="01:35.370" ttm:agent="v1">I shoulda died now, I don't wanna see the pops</p>
      <p begin="01:35.370" end="01:37.660" ttm:agent="v1">You run from the bitches, you don't run from no cops</p>
      <p begin="01:37.660" end="01:40.140" ttm:agent="v1">Aye no cops no stops, I'm pushin' 180 on the block</p>
      <p begin="01:40.140" end="01:43.020" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gang sellin' rock and I heard that you an opp</p>
      <p begin="01:43.020" end="01:45.250" ttm:agent="v1">Your whip clapped and your bitch a bot</p>
      <p begin="01:45.250" end="01:47.200" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm good with the hoes n' your not yuh</p>
      <p begin="01:47.200" end="01:50.080" ttm:agent="v1">Aye don't pull up to the meet if you driving an EV</p>
      <p begin="01:50.080" end="01:52.570" ttm:agent="v1">We'll kick you out, spin yo' block like a CD</p>
      <p begin="01:52.570" end="01:56.790" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck your J-series, that's easy, black whip blacked tint, can't see me</p>
      <p begin="01:56.790" end="01:59.740" ttm:agent="v1">Aye no cops no stops, I'm pushin' 180 on the block</p>
      <p begin="01:59.740" end="02:02.880" ttm:agent="v1">I been with the gang sellin' rock and I heard that you an opp</p>
      <p begin="02:02.880" end="02:04.620" ttm:agent="v1">Your whip clapped and your bitch a bot</p>
      <p begin="02:04.620" end="02:06.550" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm good with the hoes n' your not yuh</p>
